    44	    print("ERROR: this rejection turns on G9(b), the polarity-flipped hinted-oracle gate.")
    45	    print("       G9(b) was retired to a DIAGNOSTIC on 2026-09-05: a family that")
    46	    print("       dissolves when you name the trick is one whose difficulty lies in")
    47	    print("       FINDING the insight, which is what this corpus is for. It cost 8")
    48	    print("       rejections and 23 blocked papers, 6 of which had already defeated")
    49	    print("       the four-vendor no-tool pool.")
    50	    print("       If the family passed G, V and STEP 4, SHIP IT. Record the hinted arm")
    51	    print("       in the README as a diagnostic. See prompts/codex_task.md G9(b).")
    52	    sys.exit(1)
